# Full project page layout

Canonical doc: README → **Full project page layout contract**.

Non-negotiables:

- All case studies use the shared `.project-header` in `app/work/[slug]/page.tsx`; kicker is the first element.
- Top spacing is **only** `.project-header { padding: 28px 0 48px; }` in `app/globals.css`. Never override header/wrap/main padding for a single project.
- `presentation: "visual-first"` → custom story component for body sections only; header structure stays the same.
- Project-specific CSS goes under story/gallery classes (e.g. `.klocky-story`), not `.klocky-header` layout.
